  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying a date and inviting someone",
     "texto": [
      "Months are written with a lower-case letter, unlike in English («May»). A date can be written «4. mai» and read «den fjerde mai» («the fourth of May»). Bursdag means birthday.",
      "In the present, invitere («to invite») becomes inviterer and does not change with the person. To say thank you, takk for invitasjonen means «thanks for the invitation»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
